ধরি, y = f(x) = 2x + 1
এখানে, y = f(x)
\Rightarrow x = f^{-1}(y)
আবার, y = 2x + 1
\Rightarrow 2x = y - 1
\Rightarrow x = \frac{y - 1}{2}
\Rightarrow f^{-1}(y) = \frac{y - 1}{2}
\Rightarrow f^{-1}(x) = \frac{x - 1}{2}
\therefore f^{-1}(2) = \frac{2 - 1}{2} = \frac{1}{2}

